+==== PSSHLR.HS
+
+===== Mnemonic
+
+psshlr.hs _rd_, _rs1_, _rs2_
+
+===== Encoding
+
+PSSHLR.HS is encoded in the OP-IMM-32 major opcode.
+
+[wavedrom, ,svg]
+....
+{reg:[
+    { bits: 7, name: 0x1b, attr: ['OP-IMM-32'] },
+    { bits: 5, name: 'rd' },
